  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nThe value of 35 - [28 - (60 ÷ 4 + 26 ÷ 13)] is to be calculated.\n\n**Concept Used:**\n\nBODMAS\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ 35 - [28 - (60 ÷ 4 + 26 ÷ 13)]\n\n⇒ 35 - [ 28 - (15 + 2)]\n\n⇒ 35 - [ 28 - 17]\n\n⇒ 35 - 11\n\n⇒ 24\n\n**∴ The value of 35 - [28 - (60 ÷ 4 + 26 ÷ 13)] is 24.**",
